# recognAIze needs zero secrets and zero API keys.
#
# Hard constraint (see aidd_docs/tasks/2026_08/2026_08_29-recognaize-mvp-spec.md,
# "Hard constraints"): rank, range, confidence and explanation are produced
# entirely by the deterministic path. No LLM enrichment, no network call after
# install. This file is intentionally empty of variables — it exists only to
# document that fact and to give `.gitignore` a real `.env` to ignore.
